SOAPBOX: This is an ad-HOC WPX Ssb run from W7AYT's QTH in the SF East Bay.
SOAPBOX: This was a Sunday afternoon last minute operation, running 90-watts
SOAPBOX: into a 3-element Long John Yagi about 25' high - enough to work virtually
SOAPBOX: every station heard. Unfortunately, with poor propagation, not a lot was heard.
SOAPBOX: At least I can say I wuz there.
SOAPBOX: Look for a write-up on this at: http://WQ6X.Blogspot.com.
